{"aRavakarmakacitavatkartfkat": [{"id": "aRAvakarmakAccittavatkartfkAt", "headword": "अणावकर्मकाच्चित्तवत्कर्तृकात्", "headword_slp1": "aRAvakarmakAccittavatkartfkAt", "fold": "aRavakarmakacitavatkartfkat", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes of the परस्मैपद are used after the causal of that verb, which in its non-causal state was intransitive and had a being endowed with reason for its agent, even when the fruit of the action accrues to the agent.\n\nTerms: परस्मैपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अणावकर्मकाच्चित्तवत्कर्तृकात् १.३.८८", "१.३.८८", "१.३.८८ अणावकर्मकाच्चित्तवत्कर्तृकात्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["aRAvakarmakAccittavatkartfkAt १.३.८८", "१.३.८८", "१.३.८८ aRAvakarmakAccittavatkartfkAt"]}], "aRaYO ca": [{"id": "aRaYO ca", "headword": "अणञौ च", "headword_slp1": "aRaYO ca", "fold": "aRaYO ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And the affixes अण् and अञ् come respectively after the words 1. सिन्धु and 2. अपकर।\n\nTerms: अण् and अञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अणञौ च ४.३.३३", "४.३.३३", "४.३.३३ अणञौ च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["aRaYO ca ४.३.३३", "४.३.३३", "४.३.३३ aRaYO ca"]}]}